# Jaded Analyst: "Whenever you draw your second card each turn, this creature loses defender and gains vigilance until end of turn" (CR 121.2, 603.2). "Each turn" is every turn and
# "you" is the drawer: both players control an Analyst. On turn 2 Bot2's Ancestral Recall makes Bot1 draw three cards, its first three that turn, and the second turns Bot1's Analyst
# into a vigilant creature without defender; Bot2's own Analyst has seen only one card drawn by Bot2 (the draw step's) and keeps defender. On turn 3 Bot1's Analyst has defender again.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Mox Pearl
Jaded Analyst
Island x17

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Mox Pearl
Jaded Analyst
Ancestral Recall
Island x16

